This section does not require completing the earlier section.

* '''[[Ancient Pattern]] + [[Platinum Speckled Powder]] + [[Enchanted Clay]] = [[Runecrested Bowl]]'''
** The [[Ancient Pattern]]
*** Talk to [[Alrik Farsight]] in [[Timorous Deep]] and receive a [[Crushed Pot]].
